    <title>Notes on the double Wick rotated BTZ black hole</title>
    <summary>  We analyze the double Wick rotated BTZ black hole with the Euclidean
signature, which is a Riemannian manifold. We calculate thermodynamics, total
energy of spacetime, and holographic two point functions in the double Wick
rotated background. Results agree with those of a rotating BTZ with the same
periodicity.
</summary>
